get.description:
Connexion WebSocket pour la synchronisation musicale en temps réel.
Le JWT doit être passé en query param : ?token=<access_token>

Messages envoyés par le client (hôte uniquement pour play/pause/seek/next) :
{"type":"play","payload":{"song":{"external_id":"...","title":"...","artist":"..."},"position_ms":0}}
{"type":"pause","payload":{"position_ms":12345}}
{"type":"seek","payload":{"position_ms":30000}}
{"type":"next","payload":{"song":{...},"position_ms":0}}

Messages reçus par tous les clients :
{"type":"state","payload":{"song":{...},"is_playing":true,"position_ms":0,"updated_at":"...","participants":[...]}}
{"type":"play","sender_id":1,"payload":{...}}
{"type":"joined","payload":{"user_id":2,"name":"Bob"}}
{"type":"left","payload":{"user_id":2,"name":"Bob"}}
{"type":"host_left"}
{"type":"error","payload":{"message":"..."}}
